From: Shaoying Xu <shaoyi@amazon.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Oct 2023 22:15:37 +0000
Subject: nfs: revert 3 patches that fix O_DIRECT writeback error paths.

commit f16fd0b11f0f "NFS: Fix error handling for O_DIRECT write scheduling"
commit 4d98038e5bd9 "NFS: Fix O_DIRECT locking issues"
commit 1f49386d6779 "NFS: More O_DIRECT accounting fixes for error paths"

They cause a few of nfs direct IO xfstests:generic test failures.

Signed-off-by: Shaoying Xu <shaoyi@amazon.com>
---
 fs/nfs/direct.c | 109 ++++++++++++++----------------------------------
 1 file changed, 32 insertions(+), 77 deletions(-)

diff --git a/fs/nfs/direct.c b/fs/nfs/direct.c
--- a/fs/nfs/direct.c
+++ b/fs/nfs/direct.c
@@ -93,10 +93,12 @@ nfs_direct_handle_truncated(struct nfs_direct_req *dreq,
